{"id": "sdqa0144", "pool": "sdqa", "tier": "conservative", "audio_s": 3.55, "n_chunks": 4, "n_concurrent": 4, "gen_active_at_eot": true, "eot_score": 0.1685, "eot_read_ms": 19, "reference_answer": "1955", "query": "When was Rocketdyne founded?", "transcript": "When was Rocketdyne founded?", "mode": "local", "answer": "Once upon a time a small dragon lived in a quiet valley beside a slow green river. Every morning Rocket the dragon found a different flower to eat for breakfast. He liked the sweetest flowers most of all. One day Rocket saw a flower that glowed like fire. He thought it would be perfect for his breakfast. But when he ate it he felt strange. His scales started to glow and he grew bigger and bigger. Rocket realized he was turning into a real dragon. He was no longer just a small dragon but a powerful one. Rocket flew over the valley and watched from above. He saw how small everything looked now. He knew he could protect the valley from any danger. Rocket decided to stay in the valley forever. He used his powers to keep everyone safe. And every morning he still looked for new flowers to eat. But now he chose carefully because he had learned that some flowers were not meant to be eaten by dragons.", "answer_ms": 4063}
